# Activity

Purpose: the pulse — what just happened, by whom, to what. Exists
because shared awareness beats status meetings; the feed is ambient
context everyone absorbs in passing.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 4x5) | |
| variant | layout | timeline (rail) / dense log (wide) | auto by width |
| title | display | text | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| limit | display | n (default 20) | |
| day grouping | display | on / off | log variant headers |
| field diffs | display | on / off | "stage: open -> nego" |
| relative time | display | relative / absolute | |
| concept | filter | conceptId / inherit / all | |
| eventTypes | filter | event type[] (proposed) | e.g. notes only |
| actor | filter | any / member[] (proposed) | |
